WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:05.263
Your hands are full, and the question can’t wait. Now you can just ask Worklynq.

2
00:00:06.233 --> 00:00:08.089
Open Assist, and tap the mic.

3
00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:10.347
Maya: What’s still waiting at Downtown?

4
00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:20.084
Assist: Three orders are still waiting at Downtown café, and the walk-in fridge ticket is a day overdue. Chase the fridge first.

5
00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:26.557
Assist answers out loud, in the same voice you hear in our videos. The details stay on screen.

6
00:00:27.233 --> 00:00:29.047
You can get things done the same way.

7
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.215
Maya: Log a ticket for the walk-in fridge at Downtown. It was 43°F at close.

8
00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:42.905
Assist: I’ll create a maintenance ticket for the walk-in fridge at Downtown café, for Tom. Say go ahead, or don’t.

9
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.081
Maya: Go ahead.

10
00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:51.120
Assist: Done. I created DC-14 for Tom at Downtown café, priority high, due today.

11
00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:55.351
Changes still wait for your OK. Now you can give it out loud.

12
00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:58.231
Turn spoken answers off with one tap.

13
00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:04.020
Or pick a speed in your profile. Your recording is only turned into text, and never kept.

14
00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:07.289
Voice for Assist. Just ask Worklynq.

